cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KnightBase in your research or project, please cite it as below."
title: "KnightBase: A Consolidated Financial Asset Database for the Dhaka Stock Exchange (1999-2026)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Ornob"
    given-names: "K. M. Miad Hassan"
    alias: "Ow1nomics"
    email: kmmiadhassanornob@gmail.com
    orcid: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/o-rnob/knightbase"
url: "https://github.com/o-rnob/knightbase"
abstract: >
  KnightBase consolidates multiple public sources of Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE)
  historical price data (1999-2026), Bangladesh macroeconomic indicators
  (Bangladesh Bank, World Bank), and DSE corporate-action snapshots into a
  single SQLite database with full data-quality logging. Every skip, conflict,
  rename, and known gap is queryable in the data_quality_log and
  price_conflicts tables rather than silently resolved.
keywords:
  - dhaka-stock-exchange
  - bangladesh
  - finance
  - quantitative-finance
  - open-data
  - sqlite
